// ============================================================
// Acme Commerce (sample) - the root of the application
//
// Five bounded contexts in ONE application: Catalog, Storefront, Sales, Purchasing and Warehouse. They share no
// database; they talk through public events, and every context translates what it receives into its own
// language. This is the only `domain` line in the tree - the folders beneath carry no domain line.
//
//   Shared/        the shared kernel: concepts, enums, composite types, event sources, policies, personas, theme
//   Shell/         the UI profile (blueprint AppShell root, theme, packages, the one sample-data pack) and the
//                  application-level navigation (sidebar module -> feature, topbar)
//   <Domain>/model/        state changes, state views, automations, screens and specifications
//   <Domain>/translation/  Translate slices: outbound publication and inbound anti-corruption
//
// Verify it with:  screenplay --warnaserror Samples/AcmeCommerce
//                  screenplay test Samples/AcmeCommerce
// See README.md for the layout, the naming rules and the tooling (domain-package.sh, render-variant.sh).
// ============================================================

domain AcmeCommerce

reaction batches atomic
command reads protected
